WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.427
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:15.178
I'm a garden snail.

3
00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:21.717
I'm a gastropod.

4
00:00:21.718 --> 00:00:29.884
Gastropods have soft bodies and no bones.

5
00:00:29.885 --> 00:00:32.911
Where do you live?

6
00:00:32.912 --> 00:00:40.368
Garden snails live in gardens and forests.

7
00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:45.767
We like damp, dark places.

8
00:00:45.768 --> 00:00:50.149
Do snails hide during the day?

9
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:56.752
We often hide under rocks or old logs.

10
00:00:56.753 --> 00:01:01.227
Then we come out at night.

11
00:01:01.228 --> 00:01:06.412
I love your shell!

12
00:01:06.413 --> 00:01:11.057
Our shells protect us.

13
00:01:11.058 --> 00:01:20.132
Garden snails can hide inside.

14
00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:25.424
Your tentacles are cool.

15
00:01:25.425 --> 00:01:30.801
Snails have two sets of tentacles.

16
00:01:30.802 --> 00:01:36.021
Our eyes are on the top tentacles.

17
00:01:36.022 --> 00:01:45.332
We smell with our bottom tentacles.

18
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:48.453
How fast can you move?

19
00:01:48.454 --> 00:01:57.171
Garden snails move very, very slowly.

20
00:01:57.172 --> 00:02:03.780
We leave slime trails wherever we go.

21
00:02:03.781 --> 00:02:06.758
What do you eat?

22
00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:13.159
Garden snails eat plants and old wood.

23
00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:23.636
Our tongues have thousands of tiny teeth!

24
00:02:23.637 --> 00:02:26.753
The sun is setting.

25
00:02:26.754 --> 00:02:34.030
I'm going to find something to eat!

26
00:02:34.031 --> 00:02:43.122
Good-bye, Garden Snail!

